Permutohedron geometry of LRC (oracle-2026-06-01-S521o)

(1) braid-wall crossings = sum|v_i-v_j| ; distinct cyclic orders; lonely cells
 [n5 extremal (0,1,2,3,4)] crossings=6  sum|vi-vj|=20  match=True
     distinct cyclic orders visited=6 (of (n-1)!=24)  cells=6  lonely cells=0
