     distinct cyclic orders visited=10 (of (n-1)!=120)  cells=10  lonely cells=0
 [n6 (0,1,3,4,5,9)] crossings=22  sum|vi-vj|=58  match=True
     distinct cyclic orders visited=22 (of (n-1)!=120)  cells=22  lonely cells=0
