(2) metric refinement: cyclic order does NOT determine loneliness
   cyclic orders with BOTH lonely & non-lonely cells: 0 of 10
   => loneliness is a METRIC condition inside a braid cell, not an order
      property. The permutohedron is the coarse order-skeleton; LRC is
      the 1/n metric thickening (the view-obstruction).
